WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.530
- I remember, it was your,

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.240
was it the scavenger hunt birthday party?

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.240
- Yes, you actually saved me as a mom,

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.700
because we went into lockdown like a week

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.100
before my daughter's birthday.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.210
I had like this huge
party that was planned.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.570
Obviously we had to cancel it,

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.620
and then I'm like scrambling.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.080
What am I going to do?

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.390
Because I go full on into birthday mode,

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:22.120
and so I reached out to you,

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.310
you were so kind.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.100
And you sent her a video message.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:25.933
- I love the idea.

00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:29.570
- [Alyson] And giving her a
hint where one of her gifts was.

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:32.900
She just honestly...

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.733
- [Kelly] Anytime you need that.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.790
- [Alyson] And this is the video
of her watching your video.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:38.754
- [Kelly] Oh my God.
- [Alyson] And she couldn't

00:00:38.754 --> 00:00:41.081
even handle the happiness.

00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:42.610
(laughter)

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:44.010
All day, I was such a hero.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.140
She was like, "This is better than

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.600
the party ever could have been", honestly.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.433
- [Kelly] I am totally down.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:51.240
Like at some point I
want to be invited for

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.170
the scavenger hunt, because I'm a gamer.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:55.050
- [Alyson] Okay, well,
you know her birthday is

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.290
coming up again soon, because
it's almost been a year.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.750
So what are you doing March 24th?

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:00.880
- I'm probably here.
(laughs)

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.810
- [Alyson] Might just
drop her at your house.

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:03.643
Is that okay?
- Yeah, hey,

00:01:03.643 --> 00:01:07.153
I love my backyard, it's very magical.

